(text "SPI mode only: PC10/11/12 AF6, PA8 chip select; PG11 card-detect polling, active low.\n3V3 card supply and MCU rail are shared. Card peak/write current, inrush, LDO thermal budget and power-fail data integrity are unknown.\nNo UHS/1.8V signaling, SDMMC or hot-plug qualification. Internal service socket: Molex -25..85C rating limits the assembly." (at 25.4 365 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0f70bbc6-59c9-50ce-ad93-d6c68c837d51"))
